        <h2 class="section-headline">Why Single-Source<br>Matters</h2>
        <p>In industrial equipment, the weakest link is almost always the handoff. When a design firm passes a drawing to a fabricator, and the fabricator passes equipment to an installation contractor, and the contractor hands over to a maintenance team — critical knowledge is lost at every transfer. Nobody owns the outcome.</p>
        <p><strong>Jayveecons is built to eliminate that problem.</strong> The engineer who designed your conveyor is available to answer your installation team's questions. The fabricator who built your kiln can diagnose why a component has worn faster than expected. The commissioning engineer can write the maintenance procedure because they ran the machine.</p>
        <blockquote><p>"Customer satisfaction comes in providing cost-effective and superior products and services coupled with technological innovation."</p></blockquote>
        <p>That philosophy was written into our founding mission in 1987. Every service we offer exists to deliver on it.</p>
